    <string name="privacy_p1">What we collect: your name, contact details, bookings and, for check-in, an identity document (passport for international guests; Fayda or kebele ID for residents).</string>
    <string name="privacy_p2">Why: to make and manage reservations and to register guests, as Ethiopian hotels are required to do. We ask for your explicit consent before collecting your ID.</string>
